                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 836/86.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Dudley to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-01-03"><hi rendition="#italic">January 3,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Brazilian Congress continues during 1908 existing 20 per cent tariff reduction
                    favor United States.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dudley.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
